{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02578",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.64,
      "end_seconds": 3.07,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "Afternoon, thanks for coming in."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 4.39,
      "end_seconds": 11.12,
      "duration_seconds": 6.73,
      "text": "Let me think, uh, hello, thanks for fitting me in."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 16.05,
      "end_seconds": 18.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "Start wherever you like, I'm listening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 19.62,
      "end_seconds": 26.03,
      "duration_seconds": 6.41,
      "text": "Well, uh, I've been having a widespread rash with fever."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 31.42,
      "end_seconds": 38.46,
      "duration_seconds": 7.04,
      "text": "Can you tell me when it first started? I'll explain everything as we go along."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 39.66,
      "end_seconds": 47.86,
      "duration_seconds": 8.2,
      "text": "It's been three weeks, I'm fairly sure. I did try to ignore it for a while."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 51.7,
      "end_seconds": 60.34,
      "duration_seconds": 8.64,
      "text": "Can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 61.9,
      "end_seconds": 79.51,
      "duration_seconds": 17.61,
      "text": "Um, uh, it's severe, honestly. Honestly, on and off. I'm hoping you can tell me something definite. I did have swollen glands at one point, but that's gone now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 81.11,
      "end_seconds": 87.08,
      "duration_seconds": 5.97,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any blisters, mouth sores or breathing difficulty?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 88.77,
      "end_seconds": 92.79,
      "duration_seconds": 4.02,
      "text": "No, uh, none that I've noticed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 94.88,
      "end_seconds": 98.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.35,
      "text": "Has your heart given you any trouble?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 99.75,
      "end_seconds": 101.45,
      "duration_seconds": 1.7,
      "text": "Nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 103.07,
      "end_seconds": 105.9,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "Any muscle or joint problems besides this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 107.14,
      "end_seconds": 110.37,
      "duration_seconds": 3.23,
      "text": "Ah, no, joints are fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 112.01,
      "end_seconds": 117.1,
      "duration_seconds": 5.09,
      "text": "So, any allergies to tablets, food or anything in the environment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 119.17,
      "end_seconds": 124.82,
      "duration_seconds": 5.65,
      "text": "Yes, plasters, it gives me a red itchy rash."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 125.4,
      "end_seconds": 127.62,
      "duration_seconds": 2.22,
      "text": "Anything surgical in your history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 128.29,
      "end_seconds": 137.38,
      "duration_seconds": 9.09,
      "text": "Yes, I had my septum straightened, in my thirties. My neighbour said I should get it looked at."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 148.8,
      "end_seconds": 151.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "Let's run through your medicines."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 153.06,
      "end_seconds": 172.48,
      "duration_seconds": 19.42,
      "text": "Sorry, uh, what was I saying, I'm on alendronate, 70 milligrams, once a week. It's, It's febuxostat, 80 milligrams, once a day. Allopurinol, 300 milligrams, started four weeks ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 174.22,
      "end_seconds": 177.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "Has anyone ever diagnosed you with something?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 179.07,
      "end_seconds": 185.14,
      "duration_seconds": 6.07,
      "text": "I've had thin bones for five years now. Gout, for two years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 189.43,
      "end_seconds": 190.82,
      "duration_seconds": 1.39,
      "text": "What's your work?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 192.18,
      "end_seconds": 196.45,
      "duration_seconds": 4.27,
      "text": "I'm a plumber, lots of bending and kneeling."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 198.13,
      "end_seconds": 199.88,
      "duration_seconds": 1.75,
      "text": "How are your meals?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 200.81,
      "end_seconds": 205.53,
      "duration_seconds": 4.72,
      "text": "I grab fast food at lunch most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 206.65,
      "end_seconds": 208.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.04,
      "text": "I'll do your observations first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 222.38,
      "end_seconds": 224.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "Okay, this won't take long..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 236.59,
      "end_seconds": 243.52,
      "duration_seconds": 6.93,
      "text": "Okay: saturation 98 percent, pulse is 106 beats a minute, pressure 120 over 69."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 244.7,
      "end_seconds": 246.44,
      "duration_seconds": 1.74,
      "text": "Is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 247.02,
      "end_seconds": 250.56,
      "duration_seconds": 3.54,
      "text": "Okay, I'll interpret them after the examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 251.97,
      "end_seconds": 254.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.71,
      "text": "Let's move on to the examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 256.24,
      "end_seconds": 258.15,
      "duration_seconds": 1.91,
      "text": "Right, look straight ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 267.23,
      "end_seconds": 273.95,
      "duration_seconds": 6.72,
      "text": "There is a widespread red rash, facial swelling, and your temperature is high with enlarged glands."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 276.64,
      "end_seconds": 278.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.08,
      "text": "You can sit up now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 288.43,
      "end_seconds": 298.79,
      "duration_seconds": 10.36,
      "text": "Okay, thinking it through, I can't pin this down yet. We're looking at a severe drug reaction or a viral rash."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 299.92,
      "end_seconds": 305.22,
      "duration_seconds": 5.3,
      "text": "Hmm, I'm scared it's something bad. Is it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 307.15,
      "end_seconds": 317.69,
      "duration_seconds": 10.54,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's a severe drug reaction, and we'll know more once the urgent blood tests is back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 334.83,
      "end_seconds": 339.1,
      "duration_seconds": 4.27,
      "text": "Let's get urgent blood tests, for severe drug reaction."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 340.01,
      "end_seconds": 344.38,
      "duration_seconds": 4.37,
      "text": "I can book that for Thursday at 3:30 pm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 348.36,
      "end_seconds": 357.7,
      "duration_seconds": 9.34,
      "text": "I'll start you on prednisolone, 40 milligrams, once a day, until review. You take it by mouth. That's for severe drug reaction."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 359.77,
      "end_seconds": 361.26,
      "duration_seconds": 1.49,
      "text": "That's simple enough."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 362.18,
      "end_seconds": 368.15,
      "duration_seconds": 5.97,
      "text": "Stop the allopurinol now and you need admission. Have I covered everything you wanted?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 369.82,
      "end_seconds": 374.56,
      "duration_seconds": 4.74,
      "text": "I mean, okay, that makes sense. Thanks for explaining."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 376.02,
      "end_seconds": 377.34,
      "duration_seconds": 1.32,
      "text": "Goodbye for now."
    }
  ]
}